            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.19.16+EXO.19.17+EXO.19.18+EXO.19.19+EXO.19.20+EXO.19.21+EXO.19.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 19.16–22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.18+EXO.20.19+EXO.20.20+EXO.20.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20.18–21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.11+DEU.4.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 4.11–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.22+DEU.5.23+DEU.5.24+DEU.5.25+DEU.5.26+DEU.5.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5.22–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have not come, as the people of Israel came, to what you can feel, to Mount Sinai with its blazing fire, the darkness and the gloom, the storm, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the blast of a trumpet, and the sound of a voice. When the people heard the voice, they begged not to hear another word, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.19.12+EXO.19.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 19.12–13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because they could not bear the order which said, “If even an animal touches the mountain, it must be stoned to death.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.9.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 9.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sight was so terrifying that Moses said, “I am trembling and afraid!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Instead, you have come to Mount Zion and to the city of the living God, the heavenly Jerusalem, with its thousands of angels. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have come to the joyful gathering of God's firstborn, whose names are written in heaven. You have come to God, who is the judge of all people, and to the spirits of good people made perfect. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 4.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You have come to Jesus, who arranged the new covenant, and to the sprinkled blood that promises much better things than does the blood of Abel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
